<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-65] fix dependencies on incompatible versions of netty</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-65</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;bookkeeper-benchmark and hedwig-client depend on netty 3.1.2.GA&lt;br/&gt;
bookkeeper-server depends on netty 3.2.4.Final&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;These versions are actually incompatible, due to a change to ProtobufDecoder constructor&apos;s signature&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12521569">BOOKKEEPER-65</key>
            <summary>fix dependencies on incompatible versions of netty</summary>
