                            <comment id="13098835" author="mmorel" created="Wed, 7 Sep 2011 10:32:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;patch that homogeneizes dependencies of netty to 3.2.4.Final&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13103476" author="ikelly" created="Tue, 13 Sep 2011 09:10:34 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;running mvn clean test with this patch applied causes failures in tests for me. Failures attached.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13105263" author="mmorel" created="Thu, 15 Sep 2011 10:49:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I can&apos;t reproduce what you see. Tests pass fine when I apply the patch. Probably one of us has something special on the test machine.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We really need a continuous integration environment!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13105283" author="ikelly" created="Thu, 15 Sep 2011 11:24:55 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;From what I hear, the ZK 3.4 branch has been cut, and they&apos;ve only 4 blockers left, so it should be out pretty soon. Then we will have it. I&apos;ll have another look at this later today.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
